      "id": "compact",
      "decision": "official-upstream-direct",
      "inArtifactNormalizationScope": false,
      "reason": "Compact keeps its direct official LFDT acquisition under the current compatible pin. This entry covers the OFFER-FILES KERNEL and AA contract builds: migrating THOSE to Compact 0.34 / runtime 0.19 is explicitly out of scope for this project, and their pins do not move. It is not a statement about the whole repository - the shielded-night image carries its own SHA-256-pinned compactc 0.34.0 because the ledger-v9 contract it rebuilds was compiled with exactly that toolchain, and the two compilers never meet: each side's generated bindings version-check against their own compact-runtime at import time."
    },
